#: ../../source/api_Socks5ProxyAgent.md:5
msgid ""
"A SOCKS5 proxy wrapper class that implements the Dispatcher API. It "
"enables HTTP requests to be routed through a SOCKS5 proxy server, "
"providing connection tunneling and authentication support."
msgstr ""

